+// ReportHostOutput declares a file this hook wrote beside the compiler's
+// outputs, such as a census or a manifest in outDir. A later emit of this
+// generation hands the file's bytes as they are then to the host's writer,
+// after the compiler's own outputs, so every host lists it with them: a caller
